ts/characters/ganger-blue.webp","text":"The straight route was blocked by a cardboard moon. I delivered the empty travel case and got a signed receipt."}],"postDialogue":[{"speaker":"Alice","portraitAssetId":"assets/characters/alice.webp","text":"Alley’s signed receipt says EMPTY CASE, and the loading photo shows it open. His delivery never contained the film."},{"speaker":"Sherlock","portraitAssetId":"assets/characters/sherlock.webp","text":"And blue carbon dust on its handle matches a booking clipboard. Our mystery has paperwork."}],"starObjectives":[{"id":"win","description":"Win the encounter.","criterion":{"kind":"win"}},{"id":"outside","description":"Finish holding both outside districts.","criterion":{"kind":"specific-districts-held","owner":"player","lanes":[0,2]}},{"id":"motion","description":"Finish with at least 1 Motion.","criterion":{"kind":"motion-remaining","owner":"player","atLeast":1}}],"recommendedCollection":["cornball","plug","hooper"],"battlefieldAssetId":"assets/story/environments/backgrounds/01-after-hours-block-party.webp"},{"id":"sherlock-three-bad-alibis","kind":"reward","title":"Three Bad Alibis","mapPosition":{"x":91,"y":15},"prerequisites":["sherlock-alices-alibi-maze"],"optional":false,"rewards":[{"kind":"pack-ticket","id":"street-pack-ticket","amount":2},{"kind":"currency","id":"clout","amount":250,"claimKey":"story-payout-contract:v1:sherlock-three-bad-alibis:clout"},{"kind":"pack-ticket","id":"street-pack-ticket","amount":8,"claimKey":"story-payout-contract:v1:sherlock-three-bad-alibis:ticket"}],"teaching":{"tips":["Read every statement before advancing the investigation."],"focusMechanics":["story investigation"],"focusCards":["sherlock"]},"cinematic":{"videoAssetId":"assets/story/chapter-one/media/standard-clash.mp4","posterAssetId":"assets/story/theater/sherlock.webp","environmentAssetId":"assets/story/environments/backgrounds/03-promoters-back-office.webp"},"scenes":[{"speaker":"Snitch","portraitAssetId":"assets/characters/snitch.webp","text":"My alibi is a six-hour livestream with only two unexplained commercial breaks."},{"speaker":"Cornball","portraitAssetId":"assets/characters/cornball.webp","text":"Mine is a vending receipt. It charged me twice, so legally I was there twice."},{"speaker":"Promoter","portraitAssetId":"assets/characters/promoter.webp","text":"I was fixing the premiere schedule. Alone. With my blue-carbon clipboard."},{"speaker":"Sherlock","portraitAssetId":"assets/characters/sherlock.webp","text":"Snitch had opportunity, Cornball handled the canister, and Promoter has supplied both motive and stationery."},{"speaker":"Alice","portraitAssetId":"assets/characters/alice.webp","text":"Excellent. We have narrowed it down to everybody except the projector."}]}]}}
